{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'WALMART STATEMENT ON THE SALE OF RANITIDINE PRODUCTS', 'text': 'WALMART INC. IS SUSPENDING THE SALE OF ALL OVER THE COUNTER RANITIDINE PRODUCTS IN STORES, CLUBS AND ONLINE, INCLUDING ZANTAC, EQUATE AND MEMBER’S MARK BRANDS. THE COMPANY IS TAKING THIS ACTION AFTER CLOSELY MONITORING THE RECENT PRODUCT ALERT FROM THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) THAT RANITIDINE PRODUCTS MAY CONTAIN A LOW LEVEL OF NITROSODIMETHYLAMINE (NDMA). CUSTOMERS WHO PURCHASED THESE PRODUCTS MAY RETURN THEM TO WALMART OR SAM’S CLUB FOR A REFUND.'}
{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES MEET CUSTOMERS' NEEDS WITH ON-DEMAND DELIVERY IN NEW YORK CITY", 'text': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES ANNOUNCED THEIR COLLABORATION  DESIGNED TO  PROVIDE QUICK, CONVENIENT,  ON-DEMAND DELIVERY FOR  CUSTOMERS LOOKING FOR OVER-THE-COUNTER MEDICATIONS, HEALTH AND WELLNESS, BEAUTY AND GROCERY PRODUCTS. POSTMATES WILL DELIVER HUNDREDSOF WALGREENS' MOST POPULAR ITEMS FROM 174 WALGREENS AND DUANE READE LOCATIONS IN MANHATTAN AND BROOKLYN. BRINGING TOGETHER THE SCALE OF WALGREENS WITH THE ON-DEMAND DELIVERY SERVICE OF POSTMATES WILL ALLOW BOTH BUSINESSES TO BETTER MEET THE NEEDS OF THEIR CUSTOMERS. POSTMATES FOUND THAT ITS CUSTOMERS ARE SEEKING MANY OF THE EVERYDAY ITEMS FOUND AT WALGREENS. FOR EXAMPLE, THE TOP ITEMS NEW YORKERS ORDER ARE SMART WATER, GATORADE, SAN PELLEGRINO, TYLENOL AND PEDIALYTE.  FURTHER, DURING LAST FLU SEASON, FROM AUGUST 2018 TO JANUARY 2019, POSTMATES SAW A 173% INCREASE IN ORDERS FOR COUGH RELIEF ITEMS, A 111% INCREASE IN SINUS RELIEF AIDS AND A 50%SPIKE IN SOUP ORDERS."}
{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY NAMES JAN KOEPPEN AS NEW PRESIDENT IN EUROPE, THE MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 11, 2019', 'text': "THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY HAS NAMED JAN KOEPPEN AS ITS NEW PRESIDENT IN EUROPE, THE MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA. KOEPPEN, WHO HAS BEEN SERVING AS PRESIDENT OF TELEVISION AND DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER FOR EUROPE AND AFRICA, WILL TAKE OVER FROM REBECCA CAMPBELL, WHO IS MOVING TO THE DISNEYLAND RESORT BUSINESS. KOEPPEN'S NEW ROLE WILL BEGIN ON NOVEMBER 11TH, REPORTING TO KEVIN MAYER, DISNEY'S CHAIRMAN OF DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER AND INTERNATIONAL. HE'LL TAKE RESPONSIBILITY FOR DISNEY'S DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER BUSINESSES IN EUROPE, INCLUDING THE NEW DISNEY+, ALONGSIDE ITS MOVIE BUSINESSES, BUT EXCLUDING DISNEYLAND PARIS."}
{'symbol': 'WST', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES ANNOUNCES MANAGEMENT CHANGES', 'text': "ON SEPTEMBER 27, 2019, WEST PHARMACEUTICAL SERVICES APPOINTED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER AND TREASURER, BERNARD J. BIRKETT, TO THE ROLE OF PRINCIPAL ACCOUNTING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE AS OF OCTOBER 7, 2019, FOLLOWING THE DECISION OF DANIEL MALONE, VICE PRESIDENT AND CORPORATE CONTROLLER, TO RETIRE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019. MR. BIRKETT'S APPOINTMENT WILL BE IN ADDITION TO HIS CURRENT DUTIES. MR. MALONE'S DEPARTURE IS NOT RELATED TO ANY DISAGREEMENT WITH THE COMPANY'S ACCOUNTING, OPERATING POLICIES OR PRACTICES."}
