S RECEIVED $80 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM A GROUP OF INVESTORS', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 2, 2019, ADICET BIO, INC. CLOSED THE TRANSACTION. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM 18 INVESTORS INCLUDING NEW INVESTORS AMOON FUND., DSC INVESTMENT INC. (KOSDAQ:A241520), HANDOK, INC. (KOSE:A002390), JOHNSON & JOHNSON INNOVATION - JJDC, INC., KB INVESTMENT CO., LTD., OCI ENTERPRISES, INC., REGENERON PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. (NASDAQGS:REGN), SAMSUNG VENTURE INVESTMENT CORPORATION, SBI JI INNOVATION ADVISORY LTD., AND VINCOS LIMITED, AND EXISTING INVESTORS INCLUDING NOVARTIS VENTURE FUNDS, ORBIMED ADVISORS, L.L.C., PONTIFAX LTD. REPRESENTATIVE FROM JOHNSON & JOHNSON INNOVATION - JJDC, INC. AND YAIR SCHINDEL FROM AMOON FUND WILL JOIN COMPANY’S BOARD OF DIRECTORS.'}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION AND SCHLUMBERGER ANNOUNCE CLOSING OF SENSIA JOINT VENTURE', 'text': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION AND SCHLUMBERGER ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF THEIR PREVIOUSLY-ANNOUNCED JOINT VENTURE, SENSIA, THE OIL AND GAS INDUSTRY’S FIRST DIGITALLY ENABLED, INTEGRATED AUTOMATION SOLUTIONS PROVIDER. THE JOINT VENTURE LEVERAGES SCHLUMBERGER’S DEEP OIL AND GAS DOMAIN KNOWLEDGE AND ROCKWELL AUTOMATION’S RICH AUTOMATION AND INFORMATION EXPERTISE TO ADDRESS THIS FAST-GROWING MARKET. SENSIA WILL MAKE OIL AND GAS PRODUCTION, TRANSPORTATION AND PROCESSING SIMPLER, SAFER AND MORE SECURE. HEADQUARTERED IN HOUSTON, TEXAS, SENSIA IS PROJECTED TO GENERATE INITIAL ANNUAL REVENUE OF $400 MILLION AND EMPLOY APPROXIMATELY 1,000 EMPLOYEES. SENSIA WILL OPERATE AS AN INDEPENDENT ENTITY, WITH ROCKWELL AUTOMATION OWNING 53% AND SCHLUMBERGER OWNING 47% OF THE JOINT VENTURE. ROCKWELL AUTOMATION MADE A $250 MILLION CASH PAYMENT TO SCHLUMBERGER AT CLOSING.'}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2019-10-01 12:30:00', 'title': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION ANNOUNCES SENIOR LEADERSHIP TRANSITION', 'text': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION ANNOUNCES SENIOR LEADERSHIP TRANSITION.ROCKWELL AUTOMATION - ERNEST NICOLAS, CURRENTLY VP, GLOBAL SUPPLY CHAIN, IS PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, OPERATIONS & ENGINEERING SERVICES.ROCKWELL AUTOMATION INC - MIKE LASZKIEWICZ, SENIOR VP, OPERATIONS & ENGINEERING SERVICES, ANNOUNCED HIS INTENT TO RETIRE EFFECTIVE JANUARY 31, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'NOW', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'SERVICENOW, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019', 'text': 'SERVICENOW, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019'}{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'SIMON PROPERTY GROUP, INC. ANNOUNCES AN AGREEMENT WITH RUE GILT GROUPE TO CREATE NEW MULTI-PLATFORM VENTURE DEDICATED TO DIGITAL VALUE SHOPPING', 'text': "SIMON ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT WITH RUE GILT GROUPE TO CREATE A NEW MULTI-PLATFORM VENTURE DEDICATED TO DIGITAL VALUE SHOPPING. THE NEW VENTURE WILL COMBINE SIMON'S IN-STORE RETAIL LEADERSHIP WITH RGG'S E-COMMERCE EXPERTISE AND INCLUDE RGG'S RUE LA LA AND GILT PLATFORMS AS WELL AS SHOP PREMIUM OUTLETS (SPO), SIMON'S NEW ONLINE OUTLET MARKETPLACE. SIMON WILL CONTRIBUTE APPROXIMATELY $280 MILLION TO THE NEW VENTURE INCLUDING THE VALUE OF SPO, WHICH HAS BEEN SUCCESSFULLY BETA TESTED SINCE MARCH 2019. DEBUTING, SPO WILL DELIVER WORLD-CLASS BRANDS AT OUTLET PRICING. FOR BRANDS AND RETAILERS ON THE SITE, SPO WILL HELP DRIVE ADDITIONAL ONLINE SALES AND SUPPORT INVENTORY OPTIMIZATION AND CUSTOMER ACQUISITION. SPO CURRENTLY ENCOMPASSES OVER 2,000 DESIGNERS AND 300,000 PRODUCTS WITH MANY MORE MERCHANTS TO JOIN OVER TIME AS NEW ENHANCEMENTS ARE INTRODUCED TO THE SITE. OVER THE COMING YEAR, SIMON WILL PROMOTE THE NEW VENTURE UTILIZING A PORTION OF ITS WELL OVER $100 MILLION PLUS ANNUAL MARKETING BUDGET AND ACCESS TO TWO BILLION ANNUAL SHOPPER VISITS. THE PARTNERSHIP WILL ALSO LEVERAGE THE COMBINED DATABASES OF SIMON AND RGG REACHING OVER 35 MILLION SHOPPERS."}{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2019-10-01 10:30:00', 'title': 'CONFORMIS AND STRYKER EXECUTE DEVELOPMENT, LICENSE AND DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENTS', 'text': 'CONFORMIS AND STRYKER EXECUTE DEVELOPMENT, LICENSE AND DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENTS.CONFORMIS INC - CONFORMIS WILL RECEIVE $14M UP-FRONT AND UP TO AN ADDITIONAL $16M IN MILESTONE PAYMENTS.CONFORMIS - ENTERED INTO A LONG-TERM DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENT WITH STRYKER, UNDER WHICH CO TO SUPPLY PSI TO STRYKER.'}{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQGS:SNPS) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF QTRONIC GMBH.', 'text': 'SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQGS:SNPS) HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE QTRONIC GMBH ON AUGUST 6, 2019. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS INCLUDING REGULATORY APPROVAL. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2019. CRAIG WALDMAN OF JONES DAY ACTED AS LEGAL ADVISOR TO SYNOPSYS, INC. KPMG DEAL ADVISORY ACTED AS FINANCIAL ADVISOR TO THE SHAREHOLDERS OF QTRONIC GMBH.\nSYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQGS:SNPS) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF QTRONIC GMBH ON OCTOBER 2, 2019.\n'}{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'SYSCO CORPORATION, ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING, NOV 15, 2019', 'text': 'SYSCO CORPORATION, ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING, NOV 15, 2019, AT 10:00 CENTRAL STANDARD TIME. LOCATION: AT THE HOUSTONIAN HOTEL LOCATED AT 111 NORTH POST OAK LANE HOUSTON TEXAS UNITED STATES AGENDA: TO ELECT AS DIRECTORS THE THIRTEEN NOMINEES NAMED IN THE ATTACHED PROXY STATEMENT TO SERVE UNTIL THE ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS IN 2020; TO HOLD AN ADVISORY VOTE TO APPROVE THE COMPENSATION PAID TO SYSCO’S NAMED EXECUTIVE OFFICERS, AS DISCLOSED IN THIS PROXY STATEMENT; TO RATIFY THE APPOINTMENT OF ERNST & YOUNG LLP AS SYSCO’S INDEPENDENT REGISTERED PUBLIC ACCOUNTING FIRM FOR FISCAL 2020; TO CONSIDER A STOCKHOLDER PROPOSAL, IF PROPERLY PRESENTED AT THE MEETING, REQUESTING AN INDEPENDENT BOARD CHAIR POLICY; AND TO TRANSACT ANY OTHER BUSINESS AS MAY PROPERLY BE BROUGHT BEFORE THE MEETING OR ANY ADJOURNMENT THEREOF.'}{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'TESLA, INC. REPORTS PRODUCTION RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2019', 'text': 'TESLA, INC. REPORTED PRODUCTION RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY ACHIEVED RECORD PRODUCTION OF 96,155 VEHICLES AND RECORD DELIVERIES OF APPROXIMATELY 97,000 VEHICLES.'}{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'TEXTRON INC ANNOUNCES CESSNA CITATION LONGITUDE ENTERS SERVICE, SIGNALS NEW DIMENSION FOR BUSINESS AVIATION', 'text': "TEXTRON INC. ANNOUNCED THE FIRST DELIVERIES OF THE COMPANY'S NEW CESSNA CITATION LONGITUDE SUPER-MIDSIZE BUSINESS JET, SIGNALING THE START OF A NEW DIMENSION IN BUSINESS TRAVEL. THE LONGITUDE RECEIVED FAA TYPE CERTIFICATION ON SEPTEMBER 21, 2019. THE LONGITUDE FEATURES THE LONGEST MAINTENANCE INTERVALS IN ITS CLASS - 800 HOURS OR 18 MONTHS - AND IS THE MOST COST-EFFECTIVE AIRCRAFT IN ITS CATEGORY. THE CLEAN-SHEET DESIGN OF THE LONGITUDE INTEGRATES THE LATEST TECHNOLOGY THROUGHOUT THE AIRCRAFT, INCLUDING THE NEXT EVOLUTION OF THE GARMIN G5000 FLIGHT DECK. THE COMFORTABLE, BESPOKE INTERIOR OF THE LONGITUDE HAS CLASS-LEADING LEGROOM, CABIN SOUND LEVELS THAT ARE NEARLY TWICE AS QUIET AS THE NEAREST COMPETITOR, A LOW CABIN ALTITUDE OF 5,950 FEET AND MORE STANDARD FEATURES THAN ALL OTHER COMPETITORS IN THIS SEGMENT."}{'symbol': 'TYL', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'TYLER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ENTERS INTO NEW FIVE-YEAR, $400 MILLION UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY', 'text': 'TYLER TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A NEW FIVE-YEAR, $400 MILLION UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY. THE NEW CREDIT FACILITY REPLACES TYLER’S EXISTING $300 MILLION SECURED CREDIT FACILITY, WHICH WAS SCHEDULED TO MATURE IN NOVEMBER 2020. IN ADDITION TO THE $400 MILLION COMMITTED REVOLVING FACILITY, THE NEW CREDIT FACILITY ALSO PROVIDES A MINIMUM OF $250 MILLION OF ADDITIONAL UNCOMMITTED FUNDING THROUGH AN EXPANDED ACCORDION FEATURE. IN ADDITION TO EXPANDING THE SIZE AND MOVING TO UNSECURED, THE CREDIT FACILITY ALSO CONTAINS IMPROVED PRICING COMPARED TO TYLER’S PREVIOUS CREDIT AGREEMENT. AT THE TIME OF THE CLOSING, TYLER HAD NO BORROWINGS OUTSTANDING UNDER EITHER THE NEW CREDIT FACILITY OR THE PRIOR CREDIT AGREEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'UDR', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'UDR, INC. PRICES $100 MILLION OF 3.200% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2030 AND $300 MILLION OF 3.100% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2034 AND ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF ALL OUTSTANDING 4.625% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE JANUARY 2022', 'text': 'UDR, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS PRICED AN OFFERING OF $100 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.200% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2030 AND $300 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.100% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE 2034. THE 2030 NOTES WERE PRICED AT 103.319% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT, PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST FROM JULY 2, 2019 TO YIELD 2.817% TO MATURITY. THE 2034 NOTES WERE PRICED AT 99.557% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT, PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST FROM OCTOBER 11, 2019 TO YIELD 3.137% TO MATURITY. THE 2030 NOTES WILL BE A FURTHER ISSUANCE OF AND WILL BE FUNGIBLE WITH AND WILL BE CONSOLIDATED AND FORM A SINGLE SERIES WITH THE $300 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR UNSECURED 3.200% NOTES DUE 2030 ISSUED ON JULY 2, 2019 (CUSIP NO. 90265EAQ3). UPON COMPLETION OF THE OFFERING, THE AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF OUTSTANDING 2030 NOTES WILL BE $400 MILLION. INTEREST IS PAYABLE ON THE 2030 NOTES SEMIANNUALLY ON JANUARY 15 AND JULY 15 WITH THE FIRST INTEREST PAYMENT DUE JANUARY 15, 2020. THE 2030 NOTES WILL MATURE ON JANUARY 15, 2030 UNLESS REDEEMED PRIOR TO THAT DATE. INTEREST IS PAYABLE ON THE 2034 NOTES SEMIANNUALLY ON MAY 1 AND NOVEMBER 1 WITH THE FIRST INTEREST PAYMENT DUE MAY 1, 2020. THE 2034 NOTES WILL MATURE ON NOVEMBER 1, 2034 UNLESS REDEEMED PRIOR TO THAT DATE. THE NOTES ARE FULLY AND UNCONDITIONALLY GUARANTEED BY UNITED DOMINION REALTY, L.P. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL REDEEM ALL $400 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS OUTSTANDING 4.625% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE JANUARY 10, 2022. THE COMPANY EXPECTS TO ALLOCATE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE SALE OF THE 2034 NOTES TO FUND ELIGIBLE GREEN PROJECTS, INCLUDING PREVIOUSLY INCURRED DEVELOPMENT COSTS RELATED TO PROPERTIES THAT HAVE RECEIVED LEED SILVER CERTIFICATION. THE COMPANY EXPECTS TO INITIALLY USE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE SALE OF THE 2034 NOTES AND 2030 NOTES TO FUND THE REDEMPTION OF THE 4.625% SENIOR NOTES. THE SETTLEMENT OF THE OFFERING IS EXPECTED TO OCCUR ON OCTOBER 11, 2019, SUBJECT TO THE SATISFACTION OF CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}{'symbol': 'ULTA', 'date': '2019-10-01 09:30:00', 'title': 'JENNIFER LOPEZ LAUNCHES HER NEW FRAGRANCE PROMISE', 'text': 'GLOBAL SUPERSTAR AND FASHION ICON JENNIFER LOPEZ LAUNCHES HER NEW FRAGRANCE PROMISE.PROMISE - IN PARTNERSHIP WITH DESIGNER PARFUMS, JENNIFER LOPEZ WILL INTRODUCE PROMISE EXCLUSIVELY AT ULTA BEAUTY IN U.S.,.PROMISE - IN PARTNERSHIP WITH DESIGNER PARFUMS, JENNIFER LOPEZ WILL INTRODUCE PROMISE EXCLUSIVELY AT BOOTS AND SUPERDRUG IN UK, LIVERPOOL IN MEXICO.'}{'symbol': 'USB', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'U.S. BANK JOINS THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF TREASURY’S BUREAU OF THE FISCAL SERVICE MENTOR-PROTÉGÉ PROGRAM', 'text': 'U.S. BANK WILL MENTOR FIRST INDEPENDENCE BANK AS PART OF THE BUREAU OF THE FISCAL SERVICE MENTOR-PROTÉGÉ PROGRAM SPONSORED BY THE U.S.DEPARTMENT OF TREASURY. DURING THE THREE-YEAR COMMITMENT, U.S. BANK WILL PROVIDE GUIDANCE AND INSIGHT TO FIRST INDEPENDENCE BANK AS IT STRIVES TO BECOME A PROVIDER OF FINANCIAL SERVICES TO THE DEPARTMENT OF TREASURY.'}{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 17, 2019', 'text': 'UNITED RENTALS, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 17, 2019'}{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'TOMTOM AND VERIZON CO-INNOVATE TO HELP IMPROVE PUBLIC SAFETY WITH 5G', 'text': 'TOMTOM AND VERIZON ANNOUNCED A 5G INNOVATION PROJECT FOCUSED ON MAKING INTERSECTIONS SAFER FOR EMERGENCY VEHICLES. TOMTOM AND VERIZON ARE WORKING TO HELP CHANGE THAT BY MAKING IT EASIER FOR EMERGENCY VEHIC